                <pb facs="0333" n="267" sameAs="frus:frus1931-41v02/pg267"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Executive Order No, 8832, Signed by President
                        Roosevelt, July 26, 1941</hi><anchor n="59" xml:id="d185-f1"/></head>
                <p>By virtue of the authority vested in me by section 5 (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >b</hi>) of the Act of October 6, 1917 (40 Stat. 415), as amended, and by
                    virtue of all other authority vested in me, I, <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >Franklin D. Roosevelt</hi>, President of the United States of America, do
                    hereby amend Executive Order No. 8389 of April 10, 1940, as amended,<anchor
                        n="60" xml:id="d185-f2"/> by changing the period at the end of subdivision
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">j</hi>) of Section 3 of such Order to a semi-colon
                    and adding the following new subdivision thereafter: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>(<hi rendition="#italic">k</hi>) June 14, 1941—<lb/>China,
                            and<lb/>Japan.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Franklin D. Roosevelt</hi></signed>
                    <lb/>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">The
                                White House</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-07-26">July 26, 1941</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
